{
    "article_summary": "The article describes a visible light-mediated, photocatalyst-free method for the oxidative alpha-CH functionalization of tertiary amines using polyhalomethanes (like CBrCl3). The reaction proceeds via hydrogen atom transfer (HAT) and iminium ion intermediates, enabling cross-dehydrogenative coupling (CDC) and Kharasch-type additions to olefins without the need for traditional metal or organic photocatalysts.",
